<PageTitle>Floating Dock — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Floating Dock</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Aceternity UI's macOS-style dock: round links on a shelf that swell as the pointer nears them,
    and on a phone a single button that unfolds them. Every tile is a real link and the phone menu
    is a <code>&lt;details&gt;</code>, so it all works with scripting off; Motion — framer-motion's
    own engine, loaded only when a dock is on the page — adds the movement.
</p>

